  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Partnership NUTIP 2024-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands Uganda Trade and Investment Platform (NUTIP) is a membership organization that supports Dutch entrepreneurs with access to the Ugandan market and a broad business &amp; social network. Over the years NUTIP has been a valuable partner to EKN in stimulating and connecting Dutch entrepreneurs, with the overall goal to support and facilitate bilateral trade. Because of the added value of the work of NUTIP to EKN, we will finance them for the coming years for certain activities aligned with our work (e.g. Day of the Entrepreneur, informative sessions on tax matters). With this contribution we expect to further strengthen the services (e.g. information sharing, network) towards Dutch entrepreneurs in Uganda, together with NUTIP.

NUTIP&apos;s strategic direction for 2024-2028 is built around the pillars of 1) improving their value proposition, 2) Member engagement &amp; communication, 3) Financial sustainability and 4) Governance and accountability.</narrative>
  </description>
